{"about_the_game":"Season 10 has started!<br><br>In Season 10, Hitoshi Shinso, a star of the general studies course who strives to become a hero, is introduced! He is a character who uses his quirk Brainwashing and Binding Cloth to prevent his opponents from making targeted moves!<br><br>In addition, new costumes and illustrations of characters wearing the costumes will be available in the game this season as well.<br>Be sure not to miss out on them!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/01_Lets_get_ready_to_rumble_v3.png?t=1742962851\" /><br>Leap into the fray with your fellow heroes...and villains! Use communication, tactics, and synergize Quirks with your team of 3 to be the last ones standing in this 24-player Battle Royale!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/02_GIF_Rumble.gif?t=1742962851\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/03_make_the_most_of_your_quirk_v2.png?t=1742962851\" /><br>Pick up your favorite characters from a quirky roster divided into 5 archetypes: Strike, Assault, Rapid, Technical, and Support. The strengths of each character are completely different depending on their unique Quirk.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/04_quirks_image_v3.png?t=1742962851\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/05_collect_items_and_get_stronger_v2.png?t=1742962851\" /><br>Find items, interact with civilians, and defeat opponents to improve your abilities and get the upper hand over other teams!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/06_items_image.png?t=1742962851\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/07_customize_your_experience_v2.png?t=1742962851\" /><br>Unlock new characters and customization options by gaining experience and completing missions. Participate in seasonal events and try your luck with tickets to glam up with exclusive items!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607250/extras/08_customize_image.png?t=1742962851\" /><br><br>The game will be updated each season to include new elements, focusing on new characters and costumes!<br>Jump in and get a hold of the rapidly changing battle conditions!<br><br>*This game is meant to be played online only. It cannot be played in offline mode.<br>*An internet connection is required to play this game.<br>*The service and its contents are subject to change or end without prior notice.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1607250/79a7fa7e465d6eb2428a5476d3e4555fe1d0897b.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1607250/96399629eb3a07fd69c697694768e741d73a2625.jpg"},{"name":"Hero of Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1607250/0cc09794249e55f9511c828e4018e66d1263e010.jpg"},{"name":"Emblem Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1607250/cf996d0be967a5ea78ef39426dd65a209371ca39.jpg"},{"name":"Influencer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1607250/385b5f6a222a19cdc0b3202c8b90f5d7a8ecbe8a.jpg"},{"name":"Lead Cheerleader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1607250/53124235f65608c3d0e5a165a7a76663adc14799.jpg"},{"name":"Ace Attacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/